This archive includes a checked-in uv.lock. Use frozen syncs so reviewers install the same Python package resolution:

  # CPU/local checks
  nix develop .#default
  uv sync --frozen --extra cpu --group dev

  # GPU experiments
  nix develop .#server
  uv sync --frozen --extra cuda --group dev

The project declares the CPU and CUDA extras as conflicting, so sync exactly one of them at a time in a given environment.
